### 📋 Summary of Changes & Why

#### 1. 🔴 Security Headers — `helmet()`
`helmet` sets ~14 protective HTTP headers with one line. Without them, browsers have no instruction to block clickjacking, MIME-sniffing, or insecure cross-origin requests.

#### 2. 🔴 Rate Limiting — `express-rate-limit`
